In this folder we are providing the optimized structure of ligand 10058-F4 that we subsequently used for docking simulations of 100058-F4 with three states of unbound MAX identified from the 3.5 μs WTD-metadynamics simulations.

We used the CHARMM36 force field–predicted structure as the initial model for the ligand 10058-F4. For the DFT geometry optimization, the theory was employed: B3LYP/6-31G* (a conventional hybrid functional with a standard basis set).



